fdlibm (exp and log1p)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

Files:      src/zurand_fdlibm.h (derived from e_exp.c and s_log1p.c)
Copyright:  Copyright (C) 1993, 2004 by Sun Microsystems, Inc.
            All rights reserved.
License:    Permission to use, copy, modify, and distribute this software
            is freely granted, provided that this notice is preserved.
Source:     https://www.netlib.org/fdlibm/

Provides exp() and log1p() for the ziggurat's slow path, so that
rng_normal() does not depend on the platform's libm. Modified: products
that feed an addition are kept from fusing into a multiply-add, word
access uses memcpy instead of pointer casts, and a negative left shift is
done in unsigned arithmetic. The notices are preserved in the file.


